error: `@mcp(tool)` on procedure `stash` cannot be exposed: its input has no JSON Schema. `Json` has no faithful JSON Schema mapping: it deserializes from every JSON value (`cratestack_core::Value`'s untagged visitor), so the only schema that matches serde is the permissive `{}` — which tells an agent nothing, and which this generator never emits (at procedure `stash` → argument `payload`). A type with no faithful JSON Schema mapping is refused rather than advertised as `{}` (ADR 0002 § Tools); remove `@mcp(tool)`, or change the input type.
 --> tests/ui/generated/mcp_json_tool_refused.rs
